---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import { SITE } from '../../data/site';
---

<Layout
  title="联系客服与技术支持渠道"
  description="灵动云官方客户服务与技术支持对接指引。提供官方专属工单系统入口、工单提交建议、账号订阅重置与防冒牌镜像站点鉴别说明。"
>
  <div class="py-12 sm:py-16">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <Breadcrumbs crumbs={[{ label: '联系客服' }]} />

      <div class="mt-6 text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        <span class="linear-badge">CUSTOMER SUPPORT</span>
        <h1 class="mt-4 text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight">
          官方客服与技术支持指引
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-4 text-base text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
          为了保护您的账号与隐私安全，灵动云采用标准化在线工单系统作为主要的技术支持渠道。
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Main Ticket Support Channel -->
      <div class="mt-14 linear-card p-6 sm:p-8">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-purple-900/50 border border-purple-500/30 text-purple-300 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M8 10h.01M12 10h.01M16 10h.01M9 16H5a2 2 0 01-2-2V6a2 2 0 012-2h14a2 2 0 012 2v8a2 2 0 01-2 2h-5l-5 5v-5z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">官方技术工单系统（首要与最高优先级）</h2>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
              登录官方专属用户中心后，点击左侧导航栏中的 **「技术工单 (Tickets)」** -> **「新建工单」**。工单会直接分配给负责线路调试的网络工程师处理。
            </p>

            <div class="mt-4 p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800 text-xs text-slate-400 space-y-1.5">
              <div class="font-semibold text-purple-300 mb-1">为提高工单处理效率，建议提供以下信息：</div>
              <div>1. 您正在使用的设备系统（如 Windows 11、macOS Sequoia、Android 14 或 iOS 18）；</div>
              <div>2. 您所使用的客户端及版本号（如 Clash Verge Rev 1.7.5 或 Shadowrocket 最新版）；</div>
              <div>3. 出现异常的节点地区名称；</div>
              <div>4. 客户端日志（Logs）中显示的简要错误信息。</div>
            </div>

            <div class="mt-6">
              <a
                href={SITE.registerUrl}
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
                class="btn-primary text-sm py-2.5 px-6"
              >
                <span>进入用户中心提交工单</span>
                <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3" />
                </svg>
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Security Warning & Anti-phishing -->
      <div class="mt-10 rounded-2xl bg-rose-950/20 border border-rose-900/30 p-6 sm:p-8">
        <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white flex items-center gap-2">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-rose-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z" />
          </svg>
          <span>安全防伪与防钓鱼提示</span>
        </h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
          请注意甄别网络中非官方认证的聊天群组与仿冒账号。灵动云官方客服人员**绝不会在任何私聊中主动向您索要账户密码、完整的订阅链接或要求向私人账号转账**。
          如遇可疑人员冒充灵动云客服，请切勿转账，并以官方工单核实为唯一准则。
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Self-service Quick Links -->
      <div class="mt-12 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <a href="/faq/" class="linear-card p-5 group flex items-center justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="text-sm font-bold text-white group-hover:text-purple-300 transition-colors">查阅全站常见问题 FAQ</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1">涵盖大部分基础配置与常见报错</div>
          </div>
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-purple-400 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7" />
          </svg>
        </a>

        <a href="/guides/" class="linear-card p-5 group flex items-center justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="text-sm font-bold text-white group-hover:text-purple-300 transition-colors">访问客户端教程中心</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1">Windows / Mac / 安卓 / iOS 详细指引</div>
          </div>
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-purple-400 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7" />
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
